{"data":[{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-10-10T23:06:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109057939306869231"],"id":"2109057939306869231","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1086,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"有个男孩发信息说，这是他长大以来好的夏天\n\n这一年他遇到了人类最强大的Ai模型Gpt_6 astra ，用上了plus 让他在学习上几乎没有阻力\n\n每天带着iphone 和AirPods ，点一杯美团自取的6块钱冰美式，练完后再去沙县吃个13元的鸡腿饭\n\n他说很开心，有一种黄金时代的错觉","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2109057939306869231"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-10-10T22:21:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109046623250829663"],"id":"2109046623250829663","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2299,"like_count":28,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":0},"text":"国父革命了11次才成功\n\n你表白了一次怎么就放弃了","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2109046623250829663"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-10-10T17:03:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108966539059744836"],"id":"2108966539059744836","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":172,"impression_count":1175593,"like_count":1166,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":293,"retweet_count":17},"text":"天呐，卧床40年，这是何等的人间地狱呀…… https://t.co/qbYMhYrtw7","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2108966539059744836"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-10-10T16:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108958234119688342"],"id":"2108958234119688342","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":17580,"like_count":378,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":153,"retweet_count":10},"text":"能绷住的可以确诊抑郁症了￼￼￼ https://t.co/xrAs0rITwP","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2108958234119688342"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-10-10T15:35:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108944393080340639"],"id":"2108944393080340639","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":11953,"like_count":377,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":5},"text":"真有此奇效？ https://t.co/d0HpfTc0AJ","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2108944393080340639"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-10-10T15:05:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108936934399844719"],"id":"2108936934399844719","note_tweet":{"text":"我曾厌恶自己的平庸\n若是完全的平庸，倒也没什么可惜的。\n偏偏上帝给了我一点灵性，又吝啬的不肯多给。这点灵性不足以让我出众，却足以让我看清自己的庸俗\n能看见美，却造不出来；能理解事理，却浮在表面\n像一只翅膀残疾的鸟。可既然是鸟，为什么不让我高飞呢？\n这问题我想了很久，后来明白，飞不起来或许不是翅膀的问题，而是眼睛的问题。\n看的太远了，忘记脚下还有枝可栖\n那些彻底平庸的，低头在地上啄食，倒也饱暖\n真正高飞的，眼里只有天空，顾不上自怜\n唯独我这样悬在半空的，既不肯低头，又无力上升，耗尽了力气，只维持一个不上不下的姿态\n但毕竟是鸟，哪怕扑腾几下，也算是对天空的回答。况且，高飞也不是唯一的活法\n飞不起来，便走完这一生\n大地辽阔，行走本身，就是一种飞翔的方式"},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":1420,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我曾厌恶自己的平庸\n若是完全的平庸，倒也没什么可惜的。\n偏偏上帝给了我一点灵性，又吝啬的不肯多给。这点灵性不足以让我出众，却足以让我看清自己的庸俗\n能看见美，却造不出来；能理解事理，却浮在表面\n像一只翅膀残疾的鸟。可既然是鸟，为什么不让我高飞呢？","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2108936934399844719"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-10-10T14:33:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108928790282080319"],"id":"2108928790282080319","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":9341,"like_count":43,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"text":"真没花吗，没花这么着急 https://t.co/IBxiLw4XwP","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2108928790282080319"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-10-10T14:02:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108920989388070964"],"id":"2108920989388070964","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":104,"impression_count":545546,"like_count":9194,"quote_count":7,"reply_count":311,"retweet_count":79},"text":"这舅妈识时务 https://t.co/Dlfsif95iW","url":"https://x.com/0xTheo520/status/2108920989388070964"},{"author_id":"1870818143071059968","created_at":"2026-10-10T13:02:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108906063835898003"],"id":"2108906063835898003","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1061,"like_count":3,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"巴西人指出一旦失去大豆中国将会陷入绝望 https://t.co/7R31